{
  "id": 124356182,
  "iid": 4961,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "editcap: flag to set unused bytes in SLL headers",
  "description": "Unused bytes in SLL Link Layer address can be random bytes.\nWhich makes the duplicate check think the packets are different.\nEven if the unused bytes was the only difference.\n\nThis flag enables editcap to set the unused bytes to zeros to enable\nthe duplicate check to detect duplicates.",
